    "text": "21 hours ago Salisbury University men’s football will host The Catholic University of America at 1 p.m. Saturday, Sept. 26, at Sea Gull Stadium. The matchup is the third game of the 2026 season for the No. 13 Sea Gulls, who entered with a 2-0 record. The Catholic University of America entered at 0-3 after losses to McDaniel, Carnegie Mellon and Franklin & Marshall. Read full article\n2",
